paying you your settlement.

1620
01:41:17,287 --> 01:41:19,289
This is all about
saving your ass, right ?

1621
01:41:19,373 --> 01:41:21,876
Save it.

1622
01:41:29,008 --> 01:41:32,304
Annie, get a hold of Darcy's address
and number as quick as possible.

1623
01:41:32,387 --> 01:41:35,432
- Yeah, sure.
