see if you were still interested.

1700
01:48:34,970 --> 01:48:37,306
Didn't you try and meet with me
a while back ?

1701
01:48:37,347 --> 01:48:41,894
Yeah, I tried, but you were
unavailable, and then out of town--

1702
01:48:41,977 --> 01:48:43,896
Well, now I'm available.

1703
01:48:43,980 --> 01:48:46,816
And as you can plainly see
I'm in town,

1704
01:48:46,858 --> 01:48:49,068
so I'm here
to take that meeting...

1705
01:48:49,152 --> 01:48:50,987
