1742
01:51:41,714 --> 01:51:43,674
I wasn't there when
you left for the prom.

1743
01:51:43,716 --> 01:51:47,929
Yeah, well, that's not why l'm
in here, so you can just go, okay ?

1744
01:51:48,012 --> 01:51:50,974
Oh, boy, I feel awful.
Are you okay ? I mean, I--

1745
