1752
01:52:19,171 --> 01:52:23,426
Cameron and his friends,
they had this big plan.

1753
01:52:23,509 --> 01:52:27,638
They rented this hotelroom
and-and--

1754
01:52:29,140 --> 01:52:31,059
It was like a suite.

1755
01:52:32,227 --> 01:52:35,981
Basically, I promised him
that I was gonna--

1756
01:52:37,566 --> 01:52:39,818
I can't believe I'm gonna
say this to you. [Sniffles]

1757
01:52:41,028 --> 01:52:43,948
I promised him that
I was gonna...

1758
01:52:44,031 --> 01:52:45,950
sleep with him
after the prom.

1759
01:52:49,537 --> 01:52:51,539
And like an hour ago,

1760
01:52:51,623 --> 01:52:53,959
