and I said,

1761
01:52:54,042 --> 01:52:57,004
''I'm sorry, Cameron.
You know, I'm just not ready.''

1762
01:52:57,045 --> 01:52:59,131
Good.
Good girl.

1763
01:52:59,214 --> 01:53:01,884
- Dad, come on !
- l'm sorry, l'm sorry. Go on.

1764
01:53:01,967 --> 01:53:04,011
Then he goes, ''Well, the limo,
the room and the tux,

1765
01:53:04,095 --> 01:53:07,682
it all cost me 400 bucks. ''

1766
01:53:07,724 --> 01:53:09,851
And I said,
''I'm sorry. I'm just not--''

1767
01:53:09,893 --> 01:53:14,022
And he cuts me off
and he says,

1768
01:53:14,105 --> 01:53:19,695
