01:54:29,687 --> 01:54:32,440
Honey...

1788
01:54:32,482 --> 01:54:34,734
you look beautiful.

1789
01:54:37,654 --> 01:54:40,574
Thanks.

1790
01:54:45,913 --> 01:54:47,832
Take me home, Dad.

1791
01:55:42,433 --> 01:55:45,269
