1797
01:56:25,104 --> 01:56:27,690
Uh, hi, it's me.
Oh, I'm glad I found you.

1798
01:56:27,774 --> 01:56:29,609
Uh--

1799
01:56:29,692 --> 01:56:31,736
Can I come up ?

1800
01:56:33,780 --> 01:56:36,283
Darcy ?
I need to--

1801
