1815
01:57:17,578 --> 01:57:20,789
Why would he tell you that ? I
didn't do the job he hired me to do.

1816
01:57:20,873 --> 01:57:22,833
Even I don't blame him
for firing me.

1817
01:57:22,875 --> 01:57:26,128
Look, I'm, uh--
You can come on in.

1818
01:57:26,170 --> 01:57:28,172
I don't have any chairs,
but if you wanna--

1819
01:57:28,256 --> 01:57:30,300
