someone was sabotaging you ?

1822
01:57:38,141 --> 01:57:41,979
Picking your brain,
swiping your ideas and--

1823
01:57:42,021 --> 01:57:46,275
Well, you-- you never
even knew what hit you.

1824
01:57:46,359 --> 01:57:49,737
