the more you dazzled me.

1842
01:58:56,518 --> 01:59:00,731
I mean, shook my world,
changed my life, dazzled me.

1843
01:59:02,775 --> 01:59:05,862
And guys like that ex-husband
of yours, he made you feel that...

1844
01:59:07,029 --> 01:59:10,533
the price you pay
just for being you...

1845
01:59:10,617 --> 01:59:12,744
is that you don't get
to have love.

1846
01:59:12,786 --> 01:59:15,330
Isn't that what you were
trying to say the other night ?

1847
01:59:15,414 --> 01:59:20,252
That you weren't complete ?
That you weren't really a winner ?

1848
01:59:21,629 --> 01:59:23,589
Everything about you--

1849
01:59:23,631 --> 01:59:26,926
how smart you are,
how good you are--

1850
01:59:27,009 --> 01:59:30,096
everything just makes me
want you even more.

1851
01:59:34,935 --> 01:59:37,688
Oh, wow.
Boy.

1852
01:59:37,771 --> 01:59:39,857
So it looks like I'm here
at 1:00 in the morning...

1853
01:59:39,940 --> 01:59:43,861
being all heroic
trying to rescue you,

1854
01:59:43,944 --> 01:59:46,614
but the truth is...

1855
01:59:46,656 --> 01:59:49,075
I'm the one that needs
to be rescued here.

1856
01:59:56,500 --> 01:59:58,502
I sure wish
I could read your mind.

1857
02:00:06,010 --> 02:00:09,639
Well, I was thinking that, um,

1858
02:00:09,681 --> 02:00:13,810
if everything you're saying
is true,

1859
02:00:13,852 --> 02:00:15,979
if I really have
my job back...

1860
02:00:21,944 --> 02:00:23,863
then I think you're fired.

1861
02:00:28,701 --> 02:00:31,788
Well, I never-- I never really
thought about it from that angle.

1862
02:00:34,958 --> 02:00:38,837
Well, not that
I don't deserve it. I-do-do--

1863
02:00:38,879 --> 02:00:40,839
I'm stuttering.

1864
02:00:54,396 --> 02:00:56,523
Now I feel kind of, uh,

1865
02:00:56,606 --> 02:00:59,359
embarrassed that I told you
I needed to be rescued.

1866
02:01:00,569 --> 02:01:03,280
But that's-that's fine.

1867
02:01:17,379 --> 02:01:19,882
That's it ?

1868
02:01:25,096 --> 02:01:27,265
I don't want that to be it.

1869
02:01:27,348 --> 02:01:29,559
I don't want that
to be it at all.

1870
02:01:29,642 --> 02:01:33,897
Then don't let a little thing like
me firing you stand in your way.

1871
02:01:38,235 --> 02:01:41,780
I didn't know
what to react to first.

1872
02:01:41,864 --> 02:01:43,908
Hey, news flash.

1873
02:01:43,949 --> 02:01:45,910
I took the wrong road.

1874
02:01:47,954 --> 02:01:50,456
What kind of knight
in shining armor would I be...

1875
02:01:50,540 --> 02:01:53,543
if the man I love
needs rescuing...

1876
02:01:53,627 --> 02:01:56,213
and I just let him
walk out my door ?

1877
02:02:04,347 --> 02:02:06,307
My hero.

1878
02:02:07,305 --> 02:02:13,159
